{"text": "To achieve the target number 24 using the numbers [2, 2, 12, 12] exactly once and by using each of the operations (+, -, *, /), we can proceed as follows:", "start": 0, "end": 154, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "One possible solution is:", "start": 156, "end": 181, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(12 div 2) × (12 - 2) = 6 × 10 = 60 div 2 = 24", "start": 183, "end": 229, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Here's a step-by-step breakdown of the calculation:", "start": 231, "end": 282, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "1. **First part:**", "start": 284, "end": 302, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "12 div 2 = 6", "start": 304, "end": 316, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "2. **Second part:**", "start": 318, "end": 337, "label": "inform"}
